{"title":"1998 IMO Shortlist Problems/C1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/C1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5c773a00becebf2fe78e775d5953e138efea9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\times n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"9\" /> array of real numbers has the sum of each row and column integral. Show that each non-integral element <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be changed to either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8713f55c70d37a64172aad91903b3c3c58354372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor x \\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/99888c89116c0d3da57911d62c7f840c4487c7b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor x \\right\\rfloor + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> so that the row and column sums are unchanged.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/C1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Coming soon...\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190112\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreproces